Problem Statement 2: Disruption-Aware Logistics Planning
Problem
ROUND 1 – PROBLEM UNDERSTANDING & APPROACH


Delivery operations are frequently affected by traffic, vehicle breakdowns, road closures, weather, driver availability, and delivery delays  A single disruption can affect multiple routes, deliveries, and activities.

Proposed Solution
We propose an AI-powered Disruption-Aware Logistics Planning System that not only detects disruptions but also understands their impact and adapts the existing plan.

Innovation

"Instead of simply detecting a disruption or creating a completely new route, our system identifies the smallest change required to stabilize the operation.”

Solution Flow

Detect Disruption
↓  
Map Affected Deliveries & Routes
↓  
Identify Dependencies & Impact
↓  
Prioritize Critical Issues
↓  
Generate & Compare Actions 
↓  
Create Minimum-Change Plan
↓  
Operator Approval

Business Value

Reduce Delays → Reduce Costs → Protect Revenue → Improve Customer Satisfaction → Increase Profitability

